---
import SectionLabel from '../ui/SectionLabel.astro';
---

<section id="about" class="section-pad border-b hairline" aria-labelledby="about-heading">
  <div class="content-wrap-wide">
    <div class="grid items-start gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[minmax(0,0.9fr)_minmax(0,1.1fr)] lg:gap-24">
      <div class="lg:sticky lg:top-32">
        <SectionLabel label="About Vulcira" />
        <h2
          id="about-heading"
          class="mt-6 font-serif text-[clamp(2rem,4vw,3.25rem)] leading-[1.05] text-[var(--color-ink)]"
        >
          Working with Apollo Twelve LLC to build a focused group of ventures.
        </h2>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 border-l hairline pl-8 lg:pl-12">
        <p class="text-[1.0625rem] leading-[1.75] text-[var(--color-ink-muted)] md:text-[1.125rem]">
          Vulcira works with Apollo Twelve LLC to create and support a focused group of ventures across fashion, culture, and long-term brand development. Each organization maintains its own identity and direction while sharing a commitment to thoughtful design, disciplined planning, and lasting value.
        </p>
        <p class="max-w-lg text-[0.9375rem] leading-relaxed text-[var(--color-ink-faint)]">
          The platform provides a central public-facing presence — connecting the group's work without reducing individual ventures to interchangeable entries in a portfolio.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
